  <item>
    <title>Vol.006【影视局】深度解析《不够善良的我们》三位主角：人到中年，什么样的选择才是心之所向？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663f6ae7af1e22bb15b0b2c1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663f6ae7af1e22bb15b0b2c1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 May 2024 12:56:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《不够善良的我们》已经大结局了，这部剧的热度持续到现在。今天一斤和明里就来跟大家聊一聊，从这部剧里我们能看到怎样的人性。两性关系、原生家庭、女性成长，在这部剧里面是如何表现的。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv65LHxk-0ZAZO_h9eqhWGVRIyGs.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>人性是不是很滑稽？沒有得到的，永遠更迷人。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fll4BtvWxRf9BVEyJsLsgrua8a3d.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【局情梗概】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Vol.006: 我们到底还要怎样才叫善良？&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>我们到底哪里不够善良？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们到底还需要多善良才够？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 生活好无趣，老公的前女友在做些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 全包黑眼线，生人勿进的Rebecca</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> 谁帮同事接电话，还去照顾同事妈妈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 被说是菲佣，气死了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 这个同事蛮适合做老婆啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 何瑞之的“责任感”人设负担</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> “我很爱我的老婆”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 一斤：生命中不能承受的中年生活之重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> 大美人的脆弱感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> Rebecca背负“童年的诅咒”吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 哪个绿茶会去对方家里照顾对方母亲啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 简庆芬与何瑞之有爱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 简庆芬与Rebecca的羁绊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> Rebecca走了简庆芬没有走的路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">32:19</a> 小奶狗不够善良吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> 明里眼中Rebecca全剧高光时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 一斤是当科幻片在看这部剧的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 爱自己投射到对方身上的复杂情愫 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2659">44:19</a> 什么是世俗意义的幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a> 我们明明足够善良啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> 简庆芬与Rebecca实际是一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3018">50:18</a> 上海有全中国最多的Rebecca？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 成长是直面人性的复杂面 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>哪里是不够善良的我们，明明是足够善良的我们啊。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>如果你在收听本期内容时，时不时默默点头，时不时咧嘴微笑，请务必点击“订阅”并点亮小红心❤️。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有任何意见或批评（口下留情），欢迎在下方留言，我们一定认真阅读，悉心听取，该改就改。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下一局，我们等你来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
